\item[S1] ULAM.AI and the UnsolvedMath Contributors, \emph{UnsolvedMath: A Curated Collection of Open Mathematics Problems}, record 156 (GREEN-068). CC BY 4.0. \url{https://huggingface.co/datasets/ulamai/UnsolvedMath}.
